id=rg477m_close_on_shutdown
name=RG477M Close apps on shutdown
version=1
versionCode=1
author=atrolle224
description=When the 477M shuts down or reboots, every user-installed app except Daijishou (and the keyboard and Magisk) is closed first and Recents is cleared. More apps to keep: /data/adb/rg477m/keep_open.conf.
